{{Passive skill box|Eldritch Battery}}

[[Image:Eldritch Battery Orb.png|thumb|upright|Energy Shield shown over mana, instead of life.]]

'''Eldritch Battery''' (often referred to as '''EB''') is a [[keystone passive skill]] that makes [[energy shield]] protect [[mana]] instead of [[life]].

==Mechanics==
{{c|mod|Spend Energy Shield before Mana for Skill Mana Costs
}}: allows paying mana [[cost]]s by spending energy shield. 
* Unlike {{psl|Blood Magic}} or {{il|Lifetap Support}}, this does not change mana costs into energy shield costs. The player still pays a mana cost, and can modify that cost with mana cost modifiers. 
* Energy shield recharge is not interrupted by energy shield spent to pay costs. Unless interrupted by damage to mana or energy shield, energy shield will continually recharge.<ref name="JatinRechargeEB" /><ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/pathofexile/comments/mnojoj/because_life_is_just_spicy_mana/gu7jkek/?context=1</ref>
* Energy shield can only be spent for mana ''costs''. {{il|page=Arcane Cloak}} will still spend mana, {{il|Apep's Rage}} will still cause mana [[loss]].
* Has negative synergy with {{il|Arcane Surge Support}}, {{il|Inspiration Support}}, {{il|Sigil of Power}}, and other mechanics that require mana to be spent.

{{c|mod|Energy Shield protects Mana instead of Life}}: allows energy shield to protect mana from [[damage]] 
* Damage may be taken to mana through {{c|mod|% of Damage is taken from Mana before Life}} or similar modifiers (e.g. {{il|Mind of the Council}}). 
* Damage that bypasses energy shield, such as [[chaos]] damage, will still bypass energy shield. 
* Damage to energy shield or mana will interrupt energy shield recharge.<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/pathofexile/comments/a1n53x/heres_a_new_unique_item_and_two_early_patch_notes/earf9ak/?context=1</ref> 

Eldritch Battery also removes the inherent 50% chance to ignore stun while you have energy shield<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/1247469</ref> even when energy shield can still take damage by protecting mana.

==Location==
Eldritch Battery is a standalone keystone located on the upper right edge of the skill tree.

